---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import "../../styles/docs.css";

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const shot = `${base}images/guides/reconcile.png`;
---

<Base
	title="Reconcile panel | Actual Budget Tweaks"
	description="Match an account to your statement from a side panel in Actual Budget Tweaks."
>
	<main class="docs center">
		<header class="docs__header stack stack--sm">
			<a href="/guides" class="docs__back">Back to guides</a>
			<h1>Reconcile panel</h1>
			<p class="docs__lead">
				Reconcile panel replaces Actual's reconcile popover and banner with a side panel. The panel
				shows live balances and lists the transactions you haven't cleared.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Starting a reconcile</h2>
			<p>Turn on Reconcile panel in the Features section of Tweaks, then:</p>
			<ol>
				<li>Open the account and click <strong>Reconcile</strong> in its toolbar.</li>
				<li>Enter the ending balance from your statement or your bank's app.</li>
				<li>Click <strong>Start reconciling</strong>.</li>
			</ol>
			<p>Accounts with bank sync can click <strong>Use bank's synced balance</strong> instead of typing it.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Using the panel</h2>
			<div class="docs__stage docs__stage--card">
				<img
					src={shot}
					width="340"
					height="811"
					alt="The reconcile panel with numbered callouts on the amount left to match, the list of uncleared transactions, the adjustment button and the finish button"
				/>
			</div>
			<ol>
				<li><strong>Left to match</strong> is your statement balance minus your cleared balance.</li>
				<li><strong>Not cleared</strong> lists your uncleared transactions. Click a check mark to clear one.</li>
				<li>If you can't find the difference, the adjustment button adds a cleared transaction for the exact amount. It has no payee or category unless one of your rules sets them.</li>
				<li><strong>Finish reconciling</strong> is available once the difference is zero.</li>
			</ol>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Finishing</h2>
			<p>Finishing locks every cleared transaction in the account. Actual marks locked transactions and asks you to confirm before you change one.</p>
			<p>To reverse it, click <strong>Undo</strong> on the notification within 12 seconds.</p>
		</section>

		<section class="docs__section">
			<h2>Stopping early</h2>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Back</strong> returns to the statement balance so you can change it.</li>
				<li><strong>Cancel</strong> ends the reconcile without locking anything.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>Transactions you cleared stay cleared, and any adjustment stays in the account.</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</Base>
